  "More reactions = a taller bar.": "Lebih banyak reaksi = batang lebih tinggi.",
  "9.6": "9,6",
  "3.7": "3,7",
  "Study reference": "Acuan studi",
  "Metricool · 2026 video average": "Metricool · Rata-rata video 2026",
  "About 10 reactions. Not 100% of followers.": "Sekitar 10 reaksi. Bukan 100% pengikut.",
  "For every 100 video views, this account records about 10 likes, comments or shares. One person can do more than one. This is a response rate, regardless of how many followers an account has.": "Untuk setiap 100 tayangan video, akun ini mencatat sekitar 10 suka, komentar, atau dibagikan. Satu orang bisa memberi lebih dari satu reaksi. Ini rasio respons, terlepas dari jumlah pengikut akun.",
  "Original TikTok Analytics": "TikTok Analytics asli",
  ": 634,200 likes + 10,000 comments + 27,600 shares, divided by 7,000,000 views = 9.6 reactions per 100 views.": ": 634.200 suka + 10.000 komentar + 27.600 dibagikan, dibagi 7.000.000 tayangan = 9,6 reaksi per 100 tayangan.",
  "Metricool · 2026 TikTok Study, page 17": "Metricool · Studi TikTok 2026, halaman 17",
  ": 3.67 reactions per 100 views, shown as 3.7. A global video reference across account sizes, not an exact comparison with 20K-follower creators. Dates and account groups differ.": ": 3,67 reaksi per 100 tayangan, ditampilkan sebagai 3,7. Acuan video global dari berbagai ukuran akun, bukan pembanding khusus kreator dengan 20rb pengikut. Periode dan kelompok akun berbeda.",
  "See likes, comments and shares separately →": "Lihat suka, komentar, dan dibagikan secara terpisah →",
  "Likes / Comments / Shares": "Suka / Komentar / Dibagikan",
