  "Each comparison uses 10,000 video views. You can see likes, comments and shares separately, instead of only one combined number.": "Setiap perbandingan memakai 10.000 tayangan video. Suka, komentar, dan dibagikan ditampilkan terpisah agar lebih jelas.",
